<item><title>Mauritius banks raise lending rates by 0.25%</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-banks-raise-lending-rates-by-0-25-3a8efa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-banks-raise-lending-rates-by-0-25-3a8efa/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>MCB’s prime lending rate is 7.15% from 23 November, while Absa’s rose to 7.95% on 18 November.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:40:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-banks-raise-lending-rates-by-0-25-3a8efa/share.jpg" length="38057" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-banks-raise-lending-rates-by-0-25-3a8efa/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
